# Lady Evangela prevents the chosen opposing creature's combat damage this turn,
# while another creature deals damage, and both deal damage normally in a later turn (CR 615.1, 514.2).
[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Lady Evangela
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite x2
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
